{"content":[{"c":["EZER"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Chieftain of a Horite tribe (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.36.21","r":"Gen.36.21","rawR":"Gen.36.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.36.21","value":"Gen.36.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 36:21"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.38","r":"1Chr.1.38","rawR":"1Chr.1.38","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.38","value":"1Chr.1.38"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:38"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Descendant and probably the son of Ephraim. He was killed while making a raid on the cattle of the Philistines (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.21","r":"1Chr.7.21","rawR":"1Chr.7.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.21","value":"1Chr.7.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 7:21"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Man of Judah, descended from Hur (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.4","r":"1Chr.4.4","rawR":"1Chr.4.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.4","value":"1Chr.4.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 4:4"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Gadite who joined David at Ziklag (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.12.9","r":"1Chr.12.9","rawR":"1Chr.12.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.12.9","value":"1Chr.12.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 12:9"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Jeshua’s son, who ruled Mizpah and repaired the Jerusalem wall (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.19","r":"Neh.3.19","rawR":"Neh.3.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.19","value":"Neh.3.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:19"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. Priest who took part in the ceremony at the dedication of the Jerusalem wall (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.42","r":"Neh.12.42","rawR":"Neh.12.42","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.42","value":"Neh.12.42"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:42"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Ezer","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 36:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.36.21","r